Upon her defeat, [[Winona]] awards you the {{badge|Feather}}, which ensures obedience from all Pokémon up to level 70 and enables the use of {{m|Fly}} in the field. This move allows you to instantly revisit any city or town you've previously explored. She also hands out {{TM|40|Aerial Ace}} as a prize, and registers herself in your PokéNav.

A short time after you leave the Gym, you receive a call from [[Scott]]. He's impressed that you defeated the Fortree Gym, and wonders if you could be the Trainer he's been searching for. He also reminds you that he'll keep cheering for you from the sidelines.

==Trick House - Puzzle 5 (optional)==
In [[Trick House]] now you can complete the puzzle 5.

==Route 121==
[[File:Hoenn Route 121 E.png|thumb|300px|Route 121]]

